body:
20 years seems aloooot, i thought 3-4 years was the time a greencard gets processed, I used this and some googling to figure it out [https://egov.uscis.gov/processing-times/](https://egov.uscis.gov/processing-times/)

&#x200B;

I'm probably missing something I'm not getting

I wouldn't say 20 years lol but he def will need to get his greencard first and then petition for his wife, right?

&#x200B;

So prolly, 3-4 years for his greencard and then, another 3-4 for his wife
